{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-02_end","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-02","title":"守卫","storyCode":"0-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"817d425975f7f2cf442e333f7540864411bde71d8de0136e0ab1c41bfa5ddee6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士一行遭遇了乌萨斯军警，一触即发之际，杀出一队有头领的特殊整合运动。\n面对整合运动，乌萨斯军警放过了罗德岛一行。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动还真是......精力旺盛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们，是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这个时候，出现在切尔诺伯格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？怎，怎么回事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"间谍吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果泄露了身份，被乌萨斯当局盯上，后果不堪设想！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（必要的话......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——小女孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别动！放下武器！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（做好防护准备，一旦对方有敌对倾向......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（烟雾？从哪里......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，对我们抱有敌意的人究竟是谁，你应该很清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"重装干员！敌袭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什，什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，小心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"她和那些普通的感染者暴徒，不是一回事！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，逃跑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"又能逃到哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"去，撕碎他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"就连手下的整合运动成员也是一副训练有素的样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是，整合运动的头目吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雾气越来越浓了......想借助雾气发动奇袭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"军警先生，我们必须立刻撤离这个区域！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果让他们封锁了我们的退路，我们就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些感染者，都给我滚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我得到的命令是防卫这条大街。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染兔子，我不管你们来这里有什么目的，想干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们是来破坏我们的城市的，自然会有人惩罚你们。乌萨斯的愤怒是无休止的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是，那这里发生的事情，和你没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每个乌萨斯人都知道，不把背脊朝向敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快滚！我们没空理你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"走！去第一汇合点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"各小队！动作要快！快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来啊！感染者混球！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们就这点本事吗？只会站在那里看着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"该死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
